     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.InterpretClinicalRecommendations</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.InterpretClinicalRecommendations\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.InterpretClinicalRecommendations\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ClinicalSME.html\">Clinical Subject Matter Expert</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"CLINREC-01\"> </a></b>Interpret clinical protocols</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can interpret clinical protocols, treatment algorithms, and care pathways described in L1 guidelines.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"CLINREC-02\"> </a></b>Validate clinical accuracy</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can validate that DAK decision-support logic and scheduling logic accurately represent clinical recommendations.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"CLINREC-03\"> </a></b>Ground-truth with field practice</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHOULD\">SHOULD</a></td><td><div><p>Can validate DAK content against real-world clinical practice through country visits and facility interviews.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"CLINREC-04\"> </a></b>Assess cross-country applicability</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess whether workflows and recommendations hold across various country contexts (80/20 rule).</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.InterpretClinicalRecommendations</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.InterpretClinicalRecommendations\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.InterpretClinicalRecommendations\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ClinicalSME.html\">Clinical Subject Matter Expert</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-CLINREC-01\"> </a></b>Interpret clinical protocols</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can interpret clinical protocols, treatment algorithms, and care pathways described in L1 guidelines.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-CLINREC-02\"> </a></b>Validate clinical accuracy</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can validate that DAK decision-support logic and scheduling logic accurately represent clinical recommendations.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-CLINREC-03\"> </a></b>Ground-truth with field practice</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHOULD\">SHOULD</a></td><td><div><p>Can validate DAK content against real-world clinical practice through country visits and facility interviews.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-CLINREC-04\"> </a></b>Assess cross-country applicability</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess whether workflows and recommendations hold across various country contexts (80/20 rule).</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><hr/><p><b>Arabic</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>السرد المُنشأ: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.InterpretClinicalRecommendations</b></p><a name=\"ar-SGAuthoring.Skills.InterpretClinicalRecommendations\"> </a><a name=\"ar-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.InterpretClinicalRecommendations\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">الملف الشخصي: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>تنطبق هذه المتطلبات على الممثل <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ClinicalSME.html\">Clinical Subject Matter Expert</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-CLINREC-01\"> </a></b>Interpret clinical protocols</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can interpret clinical protocols, treatment algorithms, and care pathways described in L1 guidelines.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-CLINREC-02\"> </a></b>Validate clinical accuracy</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><d